WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.234 --> 00:00:02.634
-Performing his new single,
"RUN,"

00:00:02.634 --> 00:00:04.033
with a little help
from The Roots,

00:00:04.033 --> 00:00:06.334
DJ Cutmaster Swiff,
and Georgia Me,

00:00:06.334 --> 00:00:08.334
once again, Killer Mike!

00:00:08.334 --> 00:00:11.067
[ Cheering and applause ]

00:00:11.067 --> 00:00:18.801
♪♪

00:00:18.801 --> 00:00:21.100
-These souls of Black folk
ain't no joke.

00:00:21.100 --> 00:00:23.734
Full of joy, resilience,
the epitome of hope.

00:00:23.734 --> 00:00:25.434
Just in how we cope,
day to day,

00:00:25.434 --> 00:00:29.100
through this maze of America,
we learn how to play and master.

00:00:29.100 --> 00:00:32.300
Had no choice but to jump
higher, run faster, move quick.

00:00:32.300 --> 00:00:34.868
They plaster god's images
criminal in every flick.

00:00:34.868 --> 00:00:37.834
In every aspect of media,
a lie's what they feeding ya.

00:00:37.834 --> 00:00:40.634
But I'm here to teach ya, bruh,
we the truth.

00:00:40.634 --> 00:00:42.801
Equipped to overcome,
we them ones.

00:00:42.801 --> 00:00:45.434
You a winner out the gate,
shawty, run!

00:00:45.434 --> 00:00:46.534
It's how you look at the world

00:00:46.534 --> 00:00:48.033
you been put in
because of your skin.

00:00:48.033 --> 00:00:50.234
Will I succumb or be
a casualty of evil

00:00:50.234 --> 00:00:52.000
or am I gonna fight to the end?

00:00:52.000 --> 00:00:54.567
Am I committed to the
progression of my people

00:00:54.567 --> 00:00:56.801
or we gonna let the state
killing us be a trend?

00:00:56.801 --> 00:00:58.701
Fight.
We always win.

00:00:58.701 --> 00:01:00.133
It's part of our legacy.

00:01:00.133 --> 00:01:01.934
From plantations to presidency,

00:01:01.934 --> 00:01:04.467
release the hesitancy
and become emboldened.

00:01:04.467 --> 00:01:06.267
We sure ain't
what they said we'd be.

00:01:06.267 --> 00:01:08.300
We Black,
so you know we holding.

00:01:08.300 --> 00:01:11.067
Through holding back 'cause the
movement's never done.

00:01:11.067 --> 00:01:12.701
Set your sights.

00:01:12.701 --> 00:01:15.167
Run, god, run.

00:01:15.167 --> 00:01:17.400
[ Cheering and applause ]

00:01:17.400 --> 00:01:25.934
♪♪

00:01:25.934 --> 00:01:27.133
-New York City.

00:01:27.133 --> 00:01:28.734
[ Cheering and applause ]
Go to church.

